# GUIShop Architecture Overview

GUIShop is a Minecraft Bukkit/Spigot plugin that provides GUI-based shops. This document covers the core architecture.

## Key Singleton Entry Point
- `GUIShop.java` - Main plugin class, access via `GUIShop.getINSTANCE()`

## Core Data Structures

### Item Definition (`src/com/pablo67340/guishop/definition/`)
- `Item.java` - Represents a shop item with prices, type, enchantments, etc.
- `ShopItem.java` - Container for a shop's pages
- `ShopPage.java` - Container for items on a single page
- `MenuItem.java` / `MenuPage.java` - Same structure for the main menu
- `ItemType.java` - Enum: SHOP, COMMAND, DUMMY, BLANK, ITEM, SHOP_SHORTCUT

### GUI Framework (`src/com/pablo67340/guishop/gui/`)
- `SimpleGui.java` - Base GUI with click handlers
- `PagedGui.java` - Multi-page GUI extending SimpleGui
- `GUIHolder.java` - Bukkit InventoryHolder implementation
- `GuiListener.java` - Global inventory event listener

### Listenable Classes (`src/com/pablo67340/guishop/listenable/`)
- `Menu.java` - Main shop menu (the first GUI players see)
- `Shop.java` - Individual shop display
- `Quantity.java` - Quantity selection GUI
- `Sell.java` / `AltSell.java` - Selling GUIs
- `Value.java` - Item value display
- `PlayerListener.java` - Command handling, opens Menu

### Item Editor (`src/com/pablo67340/guishop/listenable/editor/`)
- `ItemEditorGui.java` - Main item property editor
- `EnchantmentEditorGui.java` - Enchantment selection
- `PotionEditorGui.java` - Potion type selection
- `FireworkEditorGui.java` - Firework configuration
- `ChatInputHandler.java` - Handles chat-based input for values

## Global Caches (on GUIShop instance)

```java
// Shop cache: Map<ShopName, ShopItem>
GUIShop.getINSTANCE().getLoadedShops()

// Menu cache: MenuItem
GUIShop.getINSTANCE().getLoadedMenu()

// Sellable items table: Map<Material, List<Item>>
GUIShop.getINSTANCE().getITEMTABLE()

// Players in creator/edit mode: Set<UUID>
GUIShop.getCREATOR()
```

## Configuration Files
- `config.yml` - Main settings (loaded into `Config.java` static fields)
- `shops.yml` - All shop definitions
- `menu.yml` - Main menu definition
- `messages.yml` - Player-facing messages
- `worth.yml` - Worth display settings

## PDC (Persistent Data Container) Usage
All GUIShop item data is stored in PDC, managed by `PDCUtil.java`:
- `guishop:item_type` - SHOP, DUMMY, COMMAND, etc.
- `guishop:buy_price` - Buy price (Double)
- `guishop:sell_price` - Sell price (Double)
- `guishop:shop_name` - Display name in shop
- `guishop:buy_name` - Display name when bought
- `guishop:name` - Generic name (for DUMMY items)
- `guishop:enchantments` - Enchantment string
- `guishop:potion` - Potion info string
- `guishop:firework` - Firework info string
- `guishop:commands` - Commands to run on purchase
- `guishop:target_shop` - For SHOP_SHORTCUT items
